## 11. Amendment rule

This matrix is amended only by `TASK-260715-ypo7yo` (or a successor task that
explicitly assumes ownership), on the strength of a named resolving task. An
amendment MUST update the JSON, bump `revision`, append to `revisionLog`, keep
`validate_matrix.py` passing, and state which open constraint it closes.
Downstream tasks do not locally reinterpret a row; they raise a blocker against
the owner.

